    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Shueisha Games Title</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090390/extras/97fe7f72e1c57fc6242c45136efda34c.poster.avif?t=1751424464\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090390/extras/97fe7f72e1c57fc6242c45136efda34c.webm?t=1751424464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090390/extras/97fe7f72e1c57fc6242c45136efda34c.mp4?t=1751424464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In a world devoid of human life, you awaken as Mary, the last ear to listen, the last voice to speak.<br><br>Forsaken souls seek your help over numerous calls, in a desperate attempt to regain the feelings they've lost.<br><br>You are Mary, the last voice they hear, unraveling lost souls with just a telephone.<br><br>Souls bound with strong regrets suffer somewhere between the lands of the living and the dead, desperately waiting for someone willing to listen. Will you be that ear and voice?<br><br>How to play the game:<br>Choose the words you want to speak to the souls who cannot die and the actions you want to take to save them and advance the story.<br>Calling various souls and gathering information is the key to moving forward.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090390/extras/97fe7f72e1c57fc6242c45136efda34c.poster.avif?t=1751424464\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090390/extras/97fe7f72e1c57fc6242c45136efda34c.webm?t=1751424464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090390/extras/97fe7f72e1c57fc6242c45136efda34c.mp4?t=1751424464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In a world devoid of human life, you awaken as Mary, the last ear to listen, the last voice to speak.<br><br>Forsaken souls seek your help over numerous calls, in a desperate attempt to regain the feelings they've lost.<br><br>You are Mary, the last voice they hear, unraveling lost souls with just a telephone.<br><br>Souls bound with strong regrets suffer somewhere between the lands of the living and the dead, desperately waiting for someone willing to listen. Will you be that ear and voice?<br><br>How to play the game:<br>Choose the words you want to speak to the souls who cannot die and the actions you want to take to save them and advance the story.<br>Calling various souls and gathering information is the key to moving forward.",
    "short_description": "Hello, this is Mary. The last voice you'll talk to. Schrodinger's Call&quot; is an adventure game that uses a mysterious phone to connect with souls who cannot die. The main character, Mary, wakes up in a strange room with no memory. The player, along with the bewildered Mary, will save souls.",
